<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <!-- 覆寫 Odoo 預設首頁：注入 O.G老地方 snippet 區塊到 oe_structure -->
    <!-- 使用者可透過 Website Builder 自由編輯、新增、刪除、排序這些區塊 -->
    <template id="homepage" inherit_id="website.homepage" name="O.G老地方身體修復首頁">
        <xpath expr="//div[@id='wrap']" position="replace">
            <div id="wrap" class="oe_structure">

                <!-- 1. HERO -->
                <section id="hero" class="mk-hero" data-snippet="s_mk_hero" data-name="OG Hero">
                    <div class="mk-hero-bg"/>
                    <div class="mk-hero-content">
                        <h1 class="mk-hero-title">O.G 老地方</h1>
                        <p class="mk-hero-subtitle">不修表面，修根本。</p>
                        <p class="mk-hero-desc">讓你的身體回到平衡的起點，用職人手藝把你調回來。</p>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- 2. STATS -->
                <section id="stats" class="mk-stats" data-snippet="s_mk_stats" data-name="OG Stats">
                    <div class="mk-stats-circles">
                        <div class="mk-stat-circle">
                            <span class="mk-stat-desc">專業修復師</span>
                            <span class="mk-stat-num">10<sup>+</sup></span>
                            <span class="mk-stat-unit">位</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-stat-circle">
                            <span class="mk-stat-desc">為專業運動員</span>
                            <span class="mk-stat-desc">提供身體修復</span>
                            <i class="fa fa-users mk-stat-icon"/>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-stat-circle">
                            <span class="mk-stat-desc">到店修復者</span>
                            <span class="mk-stat-desc">數量超過</span>
                            <span class="mk-stat-num">5,000<sup>+</sup></span>
                            <span class="mk-stat-unit">人</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- 3. SERVICES -->
                <section id="services" class="mk-services" data-snippet="s_mk_services" data-name="OG 服務項目">
                    <div class="container position-relative">
                        <h2 class="mk-sec-title">服務</h2>
                        <div class="mk-sec-line"/>
                        <div class="mk-why-title">Why O.G?</div>
                        <div class="mk-svc">
                            <div class="mk-svc-left">
                                <div class="mk-svc-num">01</div>
                                <div class="mk-svc-heading">
                                    <span class="mk-svc-hl">關節鬆動，</span><br/>
                                    <span class="mk-svc-hl">讓動作回到正軌</span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="mk-svc-text">鬆開卡住的關節活動度，透過精準的手法恢復關節該有的活動範圍，減少代償動作帶來的二次傷害。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mk-svc-right">
                                <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-01-massage.jpg?v=3" alt="關節鬆動" loading="lazy"/></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-svc">
                            <div class="mk-svc-left">
                                <div class="mk-svc-num">02</div>
                                <div class="mk-svc-heading"><span class="mk-svc-hl">筋膜張力平衡，從根源消除代償</span></div>
                                <p class="mk-svc-text">筋膜是串聯全身的網絡，一處緊繃可能牽動全身。我們從整體張力出發，重新校準你的身體，平衡全身筋膜張力鏈。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mk-svc-right">
                                <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-02-stretch.jpg?v=3" alt="筋膜張力平衡" loading="lazy"/></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-svc">
                            <div class="mk-svc-left">
                                <div class="mk-svc-num">03</div>
                                <div class="mk-svc-heading"><span class="mk-svc-hl">IASTM 筋膜刀精準修復</span></div>
                                <p class="mk-svc-text">使用專業器械精準處理軟組織沾黏，深入處理纖維化組織，打破沾黏循環，讓組織重新獲得彈性與滑動能力，加速修復與還原。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mk-svc-right">
                                <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-03-personal.jpg?v=3" alt="IASTM 筋膜刀" loading="lazy"/></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- 4. TECHNIQUE -->
                <section id="technique" class="mk-technique" data-snippet="s_mk_technique" data-name="OG 修復理念">
                    <div class="container">
                        <h2 class="mk-big-serif">Why O.G?</h2>
                        <h3 class="mk-technique-sub">老派的手藝，解決根本的問題</h3>
                        <p class="mk-technique-text">你的身體不是壞了，是偏了。生活、姿勢、訓練累積的代償，讓筋膜糾結、關節卡住。O.G 不是等你痛了才來的地方——是讓你的身體回到它原本該有的狀態。像老師傅修車一樣，一個關節一個關節地把你調回來。不靠花俏的噱頭，靠的是紮實的手藝和對人體的深刻理解。</p>
                        <div class="row mt-5">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/tech-left.jpg?v=3" alt="身體修復技術" loading="lazy"/></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/tech-right.jpg?v=3" alt="深層筋膜修復" loading="lazy"/></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- 5. EXPERIENCE -->
                <section id="experience" class="mk-experience" data-snippet="s_mk_experience" data-name="OG 修復流程">
                    <div class="container">
                        <h2 class="mk-big-serif">The Restoration</h2>
                        <p class="mk-exp-sub">每次修復服務以了解你的身體開始，以你帶走修復知識結束。</p>
                        <div class="mk-steps">
                            <div class="mk-step">
                                <div class="mk-step-num">01</div>
                                <h4 class="mk-step-title">身體評估</h4>
                                <div class="mk-step-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/exp-01-consult.jpg?v=3" alt="身體評估" loading="lazy"/></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mk-step">
                                <div class="mk-step-num">02</div>
                                <h4 class="mk-step-title">問題定位</h4>
                                <div class="mk-step-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/exp-02-measure.jpg?v=3" alt="問題定位" loading="lazy"/></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mk-step">
                                <div class="mk-step-num">03</div>
                                <h4 class="mk-step-title">手技修復</h4>
                                <div class="mk-step-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/exp-03-stretch.jpg?v=3" alt="手技修復" loading="lazy"/></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mk-step">
                                <div class="mk-step-num">04</div>
                                <h4 class="mk-step-title">維護建議</h4>
                                <div class="mk-step-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/exp-04-advice.jpg?v=3" alt="維護建議" loading="lazy"/></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- 6. BOOKING CTA -->
                <section id="booking" class="mk-booking-cta" data-snippet="s_mk_booking" data-name="OG 預約區塊">
                    <div class="container position-relative">
                        <h2 class="mk-big-serif" style="color: var(--mk-white);">準備好了？</h2>
                        <p class="mk-booking-sub text-center">讓身體回到它該有的狀態</p>
                        <div class="mk-booking-card">
                            <div class="mk-booking-card-img">
                                <img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-01-massage.jpg?v=3" alt="身體修復"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mk-booking-card-body">
                                <h3 class="mk-booking-card-title">身體修復療程</h3>
                                <div class="mk-booking-card-meta">
                                    <span><i class="fa fa-clock-o"/> 60 分鐘</span>
                                    <span><i class="fa fa-user"/> O.G 師傅</span>
                                    <span><i class="fa fa-tag"/> 首次體驗</span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="mk-booking-card-desc">
                                    由專業修復師針對你的身體狀況，運用關節鬆動、筋膜張力平衡與 IASTM 筋膜刀，量身打造最適合的修復方案。
                                </p>
                                <a href="/appointment/1/schedule" class="mk-cta-btn">立即預約</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- 7. NEWS / SOCIAL -->
                <section id="news" class="mk-news" data-snippet="s_mk_news" data-name="OG 最新消息">
                    <div class="container">
                        <h2 class="mk-sec-title">最新消息</h2>
                        <div class="mk-sec-line"/>
                        <p class="mk-news-sub">關注 O.G 老地方的社群媒體，掌握最新動態與修復知識</p>
                        <div class="mk-social-block">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
                                <span class="markstudio-social-icon markstudio-ig me-3"><i class="fa fa-instagram fa-2x"/></span>
                                <h3 class="mk-social-heading mb-0">Instagram</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mk-social-placeholder text-center p-5">
                                <i class="fa fa-instagram fa-4x mb-3" style="color: #E1306C;"/>
                                <p class="mb-2">Instagram 動態將顯示於此</p>
                                <a href="#" class="mk-social-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-external-link me-1"/> 前往 Instagram</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-social-block">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
                                <span class="markstudio-social-icon markstudio-fb me-3"><i class="fa fa-facebook fa-2x"/></span>
                                <h3 class="mk-social-heading mb-0">Facebook</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mk-social-placeholder text-center p-5">
                                <i class="fa fa-facebook-square fa-4x mb-3" style="color: #1877F2;"/>
                                <p class="mb-2">Facebook 粉絲專頁動態將顯示於此</p>
                                <a href="#" class="mk-social-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-external-link me-1"/> 前往 Facebook</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mk-social-block">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
                                <span class="markstudio-social-icon markstudio-yt me-3"><i class="fa fa-youtube-play fa-2x"/></span>
                                <h3 class="mk-social-heading mb-0">YouTube</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4">
                                    <div class="markstudio-video-card">
                                        <div class="ratio ratio-16x9"><div class="mk-social-placeholder d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><i class="fa fa-youtube-play fa-3x" style="color: #FF0000;"/></div></div>
                                        <p class="mt-2 small" style="color: #bbb;">影片標題 1</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4">
                                    <div class="markstudio-video-card">
                                        <div class="ratio ratio-16x9"><div class="mk-social-placeholder d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><i class="fa fa-youtube-play fa-3x" style="color: #FF0000;"/></div></div>
                                        <p class="mt-2 small" style="color: #bbb;">影片標題 2</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 mb-4">
                                    <div class="markstudio-video-card">
                                        <div class="ratio ratio-16x9"><div class="mk-social-placeholder d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><i class="fa fa-youtube-play fa-3x" style="color: #FF0000;"/></div></div>
                                        <p class="mt-2 small" style="color: #bbb;">影片標題 3</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-center">
                                <a href="#" class="mk-social-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa fa-youtube-play me-1"/> 前往 YouTube 頻道</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- 8. FAQ -->
                <section id="faq" class="mk-faq" data-snippet="s_mk_faq" data-name="OG 常見問題">
                    <div class="container">
                        <h2 class="mk-sec-title mk-sec-title-dark">常見問題</h2>
                        <div class="mk-sec-line"/>
                        <div class="mk-faq-list">
                            <details class="mk-faq-item"><summary>Q1: 身體修復跟一般按摩有什麼不同？<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"/></summary><div class="mk-faq-ans"><p>O.G 的身體修復著重在找出疼痛的根源，透過關節鬆動、筋膜張力平衡和 IASTM 筋膜刀，從結構面解決問題，而非只是放鬆表層肌肉。</p></div></details>
                            <details class="mk-faq-item"><summary>Q2: 我需要準備什麼嗎？<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"/></summary><div class="mk-faq-ans"><p>不需要準備任何東西，我們會提供舒適的服裝供您更換，請輕鬆前來即可。</p></div></details>
                            <details class="mk-faq-item"><summary>Q3: 需要事先預約嗎？<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"/></summary><div class="mk-faq-ans"><p>建議事先透過線上預約系統預約，以確保您到店時能立即享受服務。若無預約，需視當日現場狀況安排。</p></div></details>
                            <details class="mk-faq-item"><summary>Q4: 我想取消或變更預約。<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"/></summary><div class="mk-faq-ans"><p>可以，請於預約時間前 24 小時透過系統取消或更改。</p></div></details>
                            <details class="mk-faq-item"><summary>Q5: 身體很僵硬也可以做修復嗎？<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"/></summary><div class="mk-faq-ans"><p>身體僵硬的人更需要修復！我們會根據您的身體狀況調整手法強度，循序漸進地改善關節活動度和筋膜張力。</p></div></details>
                            <details class="mk-faq-item"><summary>Q6: 修復後多久會感受到效果？<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"/></summary><div class="mk-faq-ans"><p>多數人在第一次修復後就能感受到活動度的改善。持續性的改善建議定期回來調校，讓效果持續累積。</p></div></details>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- 9. CONTACT -->
                <section id="contact" class="mk-contact" data-snippet="s_mk_contact" data-name="OG 聯繫我們">
                    <div class="container">
                        <h2 class="mk-sec-title">聯繫我們</h2>
                        <div class="mk-sec-line"/>
                        <div class="mk-contact-body">
                            <div class="mk-contact-item">
                                <span class="mk-contact-label">地址</span>
                                <span class="mk-contact-link">長安西路177巷10號</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

            </div>
        </xpath>
    </template>
</odoo>
